# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# Hammam AI — Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your values
# NEVER commit .env to Git
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# ━━━ WhatsApp Business API ━━━
# From: Meta Developer Console → Your App → WhatsApp → API Setup
WHATSAPP_TOKEN=EAAxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
PHONE_NUMBER_ID=12345678901234
# Choose any string — must match what you set in Meta webhook config
VERIFY_TOKEN=your_custom_verify_token_here
# From: Meta Developer Console → Your App → Settings → Basic → App Secret
APP_SECRET=your_meta_app_secret_here

# ━━━ OpenAI ━━━
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-proj-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
MAX_TOKENS=200
TEMPERATURE=0.75

# ━━━ Redis ━━━
# Render: use the internal Redis URL from your Redis service
# Railway/Heroku: use the provided REDIS_URL
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379

# ━━━ Security ━━━
# Strong random string — used to access /dashboard and /leads
# Generate with: python -c "import secrets; print(secrets.token_urlsafe(32))"
DASHBOARD_API_KEY=generate_a_strong_random_key_here

# ━━━ Contacts ━━━
# Hammam's WhatsApp number (without + sign, with country code)
HAMMAM_WHATSAPP=971501234567
# Optional: receive admin notifications for HOT leads
ADMIN_WHATSAPP=971501234567

# ━━━ Google Sheets (optional — leave blank to disable) ━━━
# The ID from the Sheets URL: /spreadsheets/d/THIS_PART/edit
GOOGLE_SHEET_ID=
# Full JSON of your Google service account credentials (one line)
# From: Google Cloud Console → IAM → Service Accounts → Keys
GOOGLE_CREDENTIALS_JSON=

# ━━━ Rate Limiting ━━━
RATE_LIMIT_PER_MINUTE=20
RATE_LIMIT_PER_HOUR=120
